      [
       9.84,
       11.08
      ],
      [
       12.91,
       14.2
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Linda"
    },
    {
     "text": "Hi. //",
     "start": 576.84,
     "end": 578.14,
     "chunks": [
      [
       16.5,
       17.28
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Ryan"
    },
    {
     "text": "I'm calling about the weekend activities / for young professionals. //",
     "start": 578.14,
     "end": 582.94,
     "chunks": [
      [
       19.06,
       21.71
      ],
      [
       24.95,
       26.72
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Ryan"
    },
    {
     "text": "I saw your poster / at the coffee shop / near my office. //",
     "start": 582.94,
     "end": 587.79,
     "chunks": [
      [
       29.48,
       31.03
      ],
      [
       33.18,
       34.67
      ],
      [
       36.76,
       38.29
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Ryan"
    },
    {
     "text": "Great. //",
     "start": 587.79,
     "end": 589.08,
     "chunks": [
      [
       40.82,
       41.63
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Linda"
    },
    {
     "text": "Are you thinking of joining? //",
     "start": 589.08,
     "end": 591.04,
     "chunks": [
      [
       43.43,
       45.01
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Linda"
    },
    {
     "text": "Yes. //",
     "start": 591.04,
     "end": 592.44,
     "chunks": [
      [
       47.59,
       48.49
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Ryan"
    },
    {
     "text": "I graduated in June, / and I've just started my first job, / so I don't have much free time anymore. //",
     "start": 592.44,
     "end": 599.56,
     "chunks": [
      [
       50.39,
       52.29
      ],
      [
       54.79,
       57.12
      ],
      [
       60.04,
       62.64
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Ryan"
    },
    {
     "text": "I'd like to find something fun / to do on the weekend. //",
     "start": 599.56,
     "end": 603.74,
     "chunks": [
      [
       66.23,
       68.2
      ],
      [
       70.77,
       72.6
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Ryan"
    },
    {
     "text": "No problem. //",
     "start": 603.74,
     "end": 605.31,
     "chunks": [
      [
       75.43,
       76.49
      ]
     ],
     "speaker": "Linda"
    },
    {
